<title>UK: Building &amp; Property/AMEC get UK contract.</title>
<headline>Building &amp; Property/AMEC get UK contract.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Building &amp; Property Group Ltd and its joint venture partner, AMEC Plc said on Thursday they had been chosen as the preferred bidder to build and operate a 160 million stg hospital complex in London.</p>
</text>
